{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"王阳明·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"wang-yangming","categoryLabel":"王阳明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/24_wang-yangming/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<p>王阳明（1472—1529）的生平，是一部&quot;立志成圣、历经磨难、终成三不朽&quot;的传奇：出身余姚状元之家，少年立志学圣贤；历经格竹、出入佛老的二十年求道曲折；因触怒权阉刘瑾被贬贵州龙场，却在生死困厄中&quot;龙场悟道&quot;，开创心学；其后以文官之身平定宁王等大乱，建赫赫事功，最终以&quot;此心光明&quot;从容离世。本 hub 追溯这位心学集大成者从早慧少年到知行合一之圣哲的完整历程。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：本 hub（生平与时代）只讲&quot;人生事件&quot;——何时、何地、发生了什么、为何转折；不展开心学的学理。心学&quot;是什么&quot;与&quot;为什么成立&quot;，分属其他兄弟 hub：思想体系总纲见<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>，哲学命题（心即理、良知、修养工夫）见<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>，文本依据见<a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>，传播与后世见<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>，毁誉之辨见<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。本 hub 中凡涉及学理处，只点到为止并以相对路径链向上述 hub，同一事实不重复展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径（建议顺序）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"a-prodigy-and-seeker/youth-and-ambition\">早年与抱负</a> — 家世、早慧、立志成圣（全 hub 起点，无前置）</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-prodigy-and-seeker/seeking-the-way\">求道的历程</a> — 格竹、出入佛老的方法论试错</li>\n<li><a href=\"exile-and-enlightenment/the-liuzhou-affair\">触怒权阉</a> — 上疏救人、廷杖、贬龙场的政治转折</li>\n<li><a href=\"exile-and-enlightenment/enlightenment-at-longchang\">龙场悟道</a> — &quot;吾性自足&quot;，心学诞生（全 hub 核心）</li>\n<li><a href=\"statesman-and-general/suppressing-rebellions\">平定叛乱</a> — 南赣剿匪、平宁王，事功印证心学</li>\n<li><a href=\"statesman-and-general/final-years\">晚年与身后</a> — 致良知、四句教、此心光明、三不朽</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：了解宋明理学（尤其朱熹&quot;格物穷理&quot;）的基本框架，有助于理解王阳明&quot;求理于外—吾性自足&quot;这一根本翻转的意义；可先读兄弟 hub <a href=\"../core-contributions/the-school-of-mind/mind-is-principle\">心即理之教</a>建立背景。读毕本 hub 后，建议续读<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>深入其哲学，或读<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>了解其对东亚的深远影响。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-prodigy-and-seeker","title":"A Prodigy And Seeker","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/a-prodigy-and-seeker","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"youth-and-ambition","title":"早年与抱负","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/a-prodigy-and-seeker/youth-and-ambition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"seeking-the-way","title":"求道的历程","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/a-prodigy-and-seeker/seeking-the-way"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"exile-and-enlightenment","title":"Exile And Enlightenment","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/exile-and-enlightenment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-liuzhou-affair","title":"触怒权阉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/exile-and-enlightenment/the-liuzhou-affair"},{"seq":2,"slug":"enlightenment-at-longchang","title":"龙场悟道","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/exile-and-enlightenment/enlightenment-at-longchang"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"statesman-and-general","title":"Statesman And General","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/statesman-and-general","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"suppressing-rebellions","title":"平定叛乱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/statesman-and-general/suppressing-rebellions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"final-years","title":"晚年与身后","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/statesman-and-general/final-years"}]}]}